 result←object increment arg;new;old;increment
 old←object ⎕VGET⊂'_increment'(¯1 1)
 :If 0=≢arg
     result←old
 :Else
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: increment'##.##.Error~##.##.IsInt new←##.##.Single arg
     '∆WI RANK ERROR: increment'##.##.Error 1<≢⍴new
     '∆WI LENGTH ERROR: increment'##.##.Error 2<≢new
     new,←new≢⍛↓old ⍝ Default trailing values to previous values
     '∆WI DOMAIN ERROR: increment'##.##.Error(new≤0)∧1,⍨¯1≠⊃new
     object._increment←new
     :If ¯1=⊃new ⍝ Need to figure out what the default page size is
         new[1]←⌊0.2×--/object ⎕VGET⊂'_range'(0 100) ⍝ 20% of full range
     :EndIf
     object ##.##.∆WS'Step'(⌽new)
     result←##.NoRes
 :EndIf
